Package: nomads
Title: Nomadic Pectoral Sandpiper Movement Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mihai", "Valcu", , "mvalcu@gwdg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6907-7802")),
    person("Bart", "Kempenaers", , "bart.kempenaers@bi.mpg.de", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Provides satellite tracking data from nomadic pectoral
    sandpipers published in Kempenaers and Valcu (2017)
    <doi:10.1038/nature20813>. The data can also serve as benchmark data
    for clustering movement tracks.
